d if so, how. The trace suggests that the Computer_terminal didn't automatically conclude the task after the first 'TERMINATE' from LogicExpert, but rather demanded explicit termination from multiple entities. I am analyzing the circumstances that lead to this requirement. The lack of a smooth termination after the first 'TERMINATE' suggests a system weakness.\n\n\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

